• What are the natural functional boundaries for modularisation in this product?
• Which modules are likely to wear out or become obsolete fastest, and how can they be made easiest to replace?
• Are module interfaces robust enough to withstand repeated disconnection and reconnection across multiple remanufacturing cycles?
• Can modules from different product generations be cross-compatible to extend the remanufacturing pool?
• What is the optimal module granularity — too many small modules increases interface complexity, too few reduces flexibility?